From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:02:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] contrib: gtactive3: one build tree for the Galaxy Tab Active3
 family

The port now covers two variants of the Galaxy Tab Active3: the Wi-Fi
SM-T570 (samsung-gtactive3wifi) and the LTE SM-T575 (samsung-gtactive3).
Move contrib/samsung-gtactive3wifi to contrib/samsung-gtactive3 and pick
the variant with DEVICE= (default the Wi-Fi one, so nothing changes for
existing callers): IMAGE_ID, PMOS_DEVICE and the package check follow it.

mkosi.finalize serves both: the top-level hook calls
contrib/$PMOS_DEVICE/mkosi.finalize, which is this file for the LTE
variant and a link to it for the Wi-Fi one. The channel file comes from
GTA3_CHANNEL_FILE; the Wi-Fi variant keeps /usr/lib/gtactive3wifi/
update-channel, which installed tablets and duranium-set-channel read.

build-apks.sh builds the new samsung-gtactive3-common package and both
device packages by default; the local firmware package installs with the
common package.
